[{:adr/authoritative_for ["kotoba.lang.package-contract/cid? (kotoba-lang/kotoba-lang, kotoba-lang/kotoba-lang#13) decodes via multiformats.core/cid->bytes and structurally validates [version][codec][multihash: fn/len/digest], requiring version 1 and that the digest length matches -- replaces (str/starts-with? x \"bafy\"), a prefix sniff that accepted strings containing characters outside the base32 'b'-multibase alphabet and could never have decoded as a real CID" "kotoba.package-admission/manifest-integrity-error (kotoba-lang/kotoba, kotoba#290) recomputes a manifest's real CID (canonical DAG-CBOR via kotoba-lang/dag-cbor + multiformats.core/cidv1-dag-cbor, excluding the manifest's own self-declared :manifest-cid field before hashing) and rejects a mismatch against the declared value -- catches a manifest edited without updating its pin, or a CID copied from an unrelated package, neither of which cid?'s structural fix alone can detect (both are well-formed CIDv1s, just not this content's)" "every placeholder CID across both repos' test fixtures (22 distinct strings) regenerated with genuine multiformats.core/cidv1-dag-cbor output; test/fixtures/package/positive-manifest.edn's :manifest-cid is now genuinely self-consistent (verified by a dedicated test), not a placeholder that happens to pass shape validation" "scope explicitly excludes kotoba-lang/kotoba-lang's ADR-kotoba-package-cid-lock.md's M5+ (a real registry, actual network fetch/pin/resolve of :dep/tree-cid/:component-cid content) -- this ADR advances integrity WITHIN the existing M4 milestone (manifest-driven package contract runner), it does not advance the milestone; M5 remains entirely greenfield, unstarted, correctly scoped as separate future work"], :adr/supersedes [], :adr/superseded_by [], :adr/topic "kotoba-package-cid-real-verification", :adr/related [], :adr/status "accepted", :adr/id "adr-2607072645-kotoba-package-cid-real-verification", :adr/doc_type "adr", :adr/last_verified "2026-07-07", :adr/body "see 2607072645-kotoba-package-cid-real-verification.md", :adr/deciders ["Jun Kawasaki"], :adr/artifacts "{:kotoba-lang \"kotoba-lang/kotoba-lang (cid? real CIDv1 validation, kotoba-lang/kotoba-lang#13) — 33 tests/237 assertions green\", :kotoba \"kotoba-lang/kotoba (manifest-integrity-error + regenerated fixtures, kotoba#290) — 146 tests/786 assertions green, clj-kondo clean\"}", :adr/date "2026-07-07", :db/id -1, :adr/authoritative true, :adr/title "ADR-2607072645: kotoba's package CID pinning becomes real verification, not shape-only"}]